            },
            "reviewBody": "Overall, a nice side dish and the vinaigrette is very good. I chose to steam my green beans vs. roasting which I'm sure made a differnce. I like to see a nice lively green color on my beans with a snap to them vs. a dark color and basically over cooked..."
